    "updated_at": "2016-07-18T17:23:49Z",
    "body": "But this doesn't really solve anything for implementations I think. Since CSP list is not done this way and HTTPS state isn't either. So implementers will continue to get confused as to how this actually works (and I am too, since it's still unclear to me what the actual setup implementations have is).\n",
